#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "</details>\n"
#| "Generate entire error-mitigated quasi-probability distributions sampled from quantum circuit outputs. Leverage Sampler’s capabilities for search and classification algorithms like Grover’s and QVSM.\n"
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Generate entire error-mitigated quasi-probability distributions sampled from quantum circuit outputs. Leverage Sampler’s capabilities for search and classification algorithms like Grover’s and QVSM.\n"
msgstr ""
"</details>\n"
"Bumuo ng mga kumpletong error-mitigated na quasi-probability distribution na naka-sample mula sa mga output ng quantum circuit. Gamitin ang mga kakayahan ng Sampler para sa mga algorithm ng paghahanap at klasipikasyon tulad ng Grover's at QVSM.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run a single experiment {#run-a-single-experiment}"
msgstr "Magpatakbo ng isang eksperimento {#run-a-single-experiment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Sampler to return the measurement outcome as bitstrings or counts of a single circuit.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang Sampler para ibalik ang resulta ng pagsukat bilang mga bitstring o count ng isang circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run multiple experiments in a single job {#run-multiple-experiments-in-a-single-job}"
msgstr "Magpatakbo ng maraming eksperimento sa isang job {#run-multiple-experiments-in-a-single-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Sampler to return the measurement outcome as bitstrings or counts of multiple circuits in one job.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang Sampler para ibalik ang resulta ng pagsukat bilang mga bitstring o count ng maraming circuit sa isang job.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run parameterized circuits {#run-parameterized-circuits}"
msgstr "Magpatakbo ng mga parametrized na circuit {#run-parameterized-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run several experiments in a single job, leveraging parameter values to increase circuit reusability.\n"
msgstr "Magpatakbo ng ilang eksperimento sa isang job, gamit ang mga halaga ng parameter para mapataas ang muling paggamit ng circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use batches and advanced options {#use-batches-and-advanced-options}"
msgstr "Gumamit ng mga batch at mga advanced na opsyon {#use-batches-and-advanced-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore the batch [execution mode](/guides/execution-modes) and advanced options to optimize circuit performance on QPUs.\n"
msgstr "I-explore ang [execution mode](/guides/execution-modes) ng batch at mga advanced na opsyon para i-optimize ang pagganap ng circuit sa mga QPU.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Specify advanced runtime options](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile/) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings) guide.\n"
"- Understand the [Job limits](/guides/job-limits) when sending a job to an IBM&reg; QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- [Tukuyin ang mga advanced na opsyon ng runtime](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Magsanay sa mga primitive sa pamamagitan ng pagdaan sa [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) sa IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Alamin kung paano mag-transpile nang lokal sa seksyon ng [Transpile](/guides/transpile/).\n"
"- Subukan ang gabay na [Ihambing ang mga setting ng transpiler](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings).\n"
"- Unawain ang [Mga limitasyon ng job](/guides/job-limits) kapag nagpapadala ng job sa isang IBM&reg; QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
